WEBVTT

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:02.660
I'd never seen this place before.

00:00:02.830 --> 00:00:05.000
Rinako found it where it had crumbled.

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:07.590
Do you know what it is?

00:00:08.170 --> 00:00:09.000
No idea.

00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:11.670
And guess what's in here?

00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:15.970
Around here.
It tastes like there's some water.

00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:17.720
Don't bite.

00:00:17.890 --> 00:00:21.350
Sis Riku would've easily been able
to tell what's inside.

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:24.520
Let's open it.

00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:26.610
Yeah, thanks, Sis Rin.

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:41.410
There it is! Rinako knew it.

00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:52.130
So? What do you think?

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:54.970
It's clear. This is water.

00:00:55.340 --> 00:00:58.930
All right! Rinako thought so.

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:00.350
What a discovery!

00:01:00.510 --> 00:01:03.230
Who knew this island still had some water.

00:01:03.390 --> 00:01:05.520
This place crumbled just recently.

00:01:05.690 --> 00:01:08.190
It's no wonder Sis Ritsu couldn't find it.

00:01:08.730 --> 00:01:12.440
Rinako thinks she deserves some praise.

00:01:12.730 --> 00:01:14.400
You're right. Good work.

00:01:15.490 --> 00:01:19.200
I destroyed the boulder,
so I'll ask Sis to praise me too.

00:01:19.370 --> 00:01:22.490
Yup. You did great too, Sis.

00:01:23.330 --> 00:01:25.370
So this is our last bit of water.

00:01:25.540 --> 00:01:30.170
Yeah. But we might find more
outside the island again.

00:01:36.430 --> 00:01:40.100
You're such a worrywart.
We'll find more somewhere.

00:01:40.350 --> 00:01:43.430
We might find even more great things.

00:01:44.180 --> 00:01:45.230
You're right.

00:01:46.730 --> 00:01:49.310
Are you scared of the Red Bugs, Sis Rin?

00:01:49.480 --> 00:01:52.070
Rinako will beat them up, don't worry.

00:01:52.230 --> 00:01:55.150
It's too dangerous for you.
Run if you see one.

00:01:55.320 --> 00:01:56.530
Rinako will not!

00:01:57.320 --> 00:01:58.990
Let's go tell Sis.

00:01:59.160 --> 00:02:00.450
You bet!

00:02:04.410 --> 00:02:08.370
She'll have to change the shape
of the roots to gather the water.

00:02:08.540 --> 00:02:12.630
Sis Ritsu is going to be so happy
that we found water.

00:02:12.790 --> 00:02:15.630
Let's tell her together and surprise her.

00:02:20.760 --> 00:02:21.890
Oh no.

00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:24.770
Rinako, go back to Sis right now!

00:02:24.930 --> 00:02:26.640
Huh? What is it?

00:02:26.810 --> 00:02:27.850
It's a Red Bug!

00:02:43.030 --> 00:02:45.120
I knew it. Where did it go?

00:02:51.960 --> 00:02:53.750
Sis, it's a Red Bug.

00:02:53.920 --> 00:02:56.840
You're right.
It went outside the roots and...

00:02:57.010 --> 00:02:59.720
On the roof to your left!
It got caught.

00:02:59.880 --> 00:03:01.640
How's everything over there?

00:03:01.800 --> 00:03:03.680
Everyone's with me. We're fine.

00:03:03.850 --> 00:03:05.810
-Where's Rinako-chan?
-Heading there.

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:35.960
I won't let you!

00:03:48.060 --> 00:03:50.980
Rinako-chan can't see that far.

00:03:51.270 --> 00:03:54.310
Oh well. Sis will beat it up like nothing.

00:03:54.810 --> 00:03:57.770
But Sis Rin can be so naive.

00:03:58.020 --> 00:04:01.700
Rinako can't just go back
and leave the water.

00:04:01.860 --> 00:04:06.450
How much longer till they come?
Rinako wants to hurry up and drink it.

00:04:07.370 --> 00:04:09.160
Maybe I'll just have a sip.

00:04:09.410 --> 00:04:12.870
Rinako has to make sure it's real.

00:04:13.040 --> 00:04:16.130
This is an important task. Just one sip.

00:04:30.100 --> 00:04:33.940
There, finished. Good work, Rin.

00:04:34.100 --> 00:04:35.650
But...

00:04:38.440 --> 00:04:40.480
Are you okay, Sis?

00:04:41.030 --> 00:04:44.320
I'm fine. You worry too much, Rin.

00:04:48.370 --> 00:04:49.910
Rin, it's another one.

00:04:50.080 --> 00:04:52.330
There were two on this island?

00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:55.500
It's close to where you just came from.

00:05:17.940 --> 00:05:19.440
Why didn't you run?

00:05:19.610 --> 00:05:22.820
Because the water was so close.

00:05:22.980 --> 00:05:26.910
Who cares about the water?
It's my fault again...

00:05:27.070 --> 00:05:29.160
It was just bad luck.

00:05:29.370 --> 00:05:32.450
Sis Rin, you always overthink everything.

00:05:32.620 --> 00:05:35.250
Actually, Rinako was pretty lucky. Look.

00:05:36.410 --> 00:05:39.960
Rinako beat a big one
all by herself for the first time.

00:05:40.210 --> 00:05:43.000
The water's safe too, so all's well.

00:05:43.170 --> 00:05:44.130
You're right.

00:05:44.300 --> 00:05:47.180
It's all thanks to you.
They'll all be so happy.

00:05:47.510 --> 00:05:49.970
This isn't the end, either.

00:05:50.140 --> 00:05:53.180
There has to be more water
outside this island.

00:05:53.350 --> 00:05:55.560
Lots of tasty things too.

00:05:56.980 --> 00:05:59.190
Don't look so sad.

00:05:59.770 --> 00:06:04.480
Rinako's happy because she got to eat
all her favorite things.

00:06:05.070 --> 00:06:08.530
You should be a little more selfish too.

00:06:09.030 --> 00:06:11.200
And then...see?

00:06:34.930 --> 00:06:38.730
It's my fault for not noticing
the other bug quicker.

00:06:39.350 --> 00:06:41.940
If I'd been more alert...

00:06:44.980 --> 00:06:49.950
Sis, if it weren't for you,
we'd all be long gone by now.

00:06:52.200 --> 00:06:54.450
But Sis Riku too...

00:06:54.700 --> 00:06:57.080
-Now, now.
-Now, now.

00:06:58.000 --> 00:07:00.870
Rinako doesn't care, don't worry.

00:07:01.040 --> 00:07:04.040
We can all drink lots of water now.

00:07:04.210 --> 00:07:07.380
She beat a big bug, she must he happy.

00:07:07.550 --> 00:07:10.470
We're just a bit pissed that
another Rina is lost.

00:07:10.630 --> 00:07:13.850
We'll eat and drink, make more of us,
and beat them up!

00:07:14.010 --> 00:07:14.970
That's right!

00:07:15.470 --> 00:07:17.350
So cheer up, you two.

00:07:17.520 --> 00:07:20.190
There are still 4 Rinas left.
We'll help you.

00:07:20.350 --> 00:07:21.940
It's not over yet.

00:07:23.860 --> 00:07:29.070
You're right. We won't waste
the time that Rinako-chan found for us.

00:07:29.690 --> 00:07:32.910
-That's right.
-Drink up, cheer up.

00:07:33.160 --> 00:07:37.370
Midori-chan is about to reach it,
so we must gather it all up.

00:07:37.580 --> 00:07:38.620
Okay.

00:07:42.210 --> 00:07:43.380
Here it comes.

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:45.790
Look at all this water.

00:07:45.960 --> 00:07:48.380
The water is being collected smoothly.

00:07:48.550 --> 00:07:50.880
But it's far, so it'll take a while.

00:07:51.260 --> 00:07:55.220
Okay. I'll be on the lookout
for any more Red Bugs.

00:07:55.390 --> 00:07:57.560
Is Sis Rin going to climb up?

00:07:57.720 --> 00:07:59.770
-Rinacchi will too!
-No, Rinaji!

00:07:59.930 --> 00:08:00.930
No, Rinayo will.

00:08:03.690 --> 00:08:06.770
You keep collecting water.
I'll stay on watch.

00:08:06.940 --> 00:08:09.030
Rin, don't you need to rest?

00:08:09.190 --> 00:08:11.900
I'm fine. You take it easy too.

00:08:27.630 --> 00:08:29.880
See any Red Bugs?

00:08:30.460 --> 00:08:33.260
Not as far as I can see.
But stay on guard.

00:08:33.430 --> 00:08:34.800
-Okay.
-Okay.

00:08:35.260 --> 00:08:37.140
Is the water place safe?

00:08:37.300 --> 00:08:41.220
Sis Ritsu has Midori-chan spread out,
so she'd know if there were any.

00:08:41.390 --> 00:08:42.890
All's going well.

00:08:43.140 --> 00:08:44.730
Stay on guard.

00:08:50.530 --> 00:08:53.280
She sucked up some junk again.

00:08:53.450 --> 00:08:55.610
Sis Ritsu is always so sloppy.

00:08:57.070 --> 00:09:00.450
She can't help it, she's hurrying.
Rinacchi, pick that up.

00:09:00.620 --> 00:09:01.450
Okay.

00:09:02.450 --> 00:09:03.910
Gobble, gobble.

00:09:04.080 --> 00:09:05.290
Hey, that's not fair.

00:09:05.460 --> 00:09:07.710
Yeah, Rinayo wanted some too.

00:09:07.880 --> 00:09:10.130
Oh, another one.

00:09:10.840 --> 00:09:15.260
Which way would the Red Bug come from?

00:09:15.680 --> 00:09:19.430
From what we just saw,
a sizable fog might be coming this way.

00:09:19.720 --> 00:09:21.180
Keep an eye on all directions.

00:09:21.350 --> 00:09:22.270
Okay.

00:09:22.770 --> 00:09:24.180
A massive red fog.

00:09:24.890 --> 00:09:27.100
Like that time with Ryoku.

00:09:28.520 --> 00:09:31.270
The bugs are acting like when Riku...

00:09:31.780 --> 00:09:34.940
If two or more come again,
you all stay here.

00:09:36.860 --> 00:09:38.740
I have to do something about it.

00:09:39.120 --> 00:09:41.080
This time, I'll succeed.

00:09:42.120 --> 00:09:45.660
But this time, we have
lots of leaves from Midori-chan.

00:09:45.830 --> 00:09:47.420
We'll crush them this time.

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:48.750
That's right.

00:09:49.880 --> 00:09:53.670
You should all take some leaves
while you have the chance.

00:09:53.840 --> 00:09:55.510
Yay, let's pick some leaves.

00:09:55.670 --> 00:09:57.050
All right.

00:09:57.220 --> 00:10:00.010
-Are you sure?
-We have more water now.

00:10:00.180 --> 00:10:02.470
I can grow more leaves with it.

00:10:03.100 --> 00:10:07.690
Besides, after what just happened,
we need to be prepared.

00:10:08.390 --> 00:10:11.610
If they come again,
beat them up for Rinako-chan's sake.

00:10:14.440 --> 00:10:17.110
Don't shake it too much.
You'll get Sis angry.

00:10:17.860 --> 00:10:19.110
Uh oh!

00:10:19.280 --> 00:10:21.030
Be quiet.

00:10:21.200 --> 00:10:22.450
There's a lot of leaves.

00:10:22.620 --> 00:10:24.910
Yeah, we haven't had any bugs recently.

00:10:25.080 --> 00:10:27.660
Midori-chan's grown so big.

00:10:27.830 --> 00:10:31.000
Midori-chan is such a great help.

00:10:31.170 --> 00:10:35.210
Thank you for growing so strong
with the water we give you.

00:10:35.380 --> 00:10:36.670
You're so noble.

00:10:37.090 --> 00:10:39.720
-Gobble, gobble.
-Here's yours.

00:10:45.060 --> 00:10:47.680
Midori-chan's leaves,
Midori-chan's leaves.

00:10:47.850 --> 00:10:52.060
How did you fight the bugs
before we had Midori-chan?

00:10:52.360 --> 00:10:55.070
Ryo-chan beat a big one
without any leaves, right?

00:10:55.230 --> 00:10:57.030
Really? She did?

00:10:57.190 --> 00:10:58.650
That's right.

00:10:58.820 --> 00:11:04.330
You Rina-chans might not remember,
but we all fought without Midori-chan.

00:11:17.760 --> 00:11:22.390
W-water? Why am I...? I can't swim!

00:11:39.150 --> 00:11:40.320
It's a bug!

00:11:54.710 --> 00:11:56.670
Ouch...

00:11:56.840 --> 00:11:58.460
Huh? Where am I?

00:11:59.340 --> 00:12:02.510
Whoa, what is this? It's glowing.

00:12:03.800 --> 00:12:05.010
What's it made of?

00:12:07.720 --> 00:12:10.980
What's going on? Why are they after me?

00:12:22.150 --> 00:12:23.820
Ouch...

00:12:24.200 --> 00:12:26.320
I'm scared. Totally scared.

00:12:26.570 --> 00:12:31.040
Who are they? Why...? How did I get here?

00:12:37.040 --> 00:12:39.300
It moved! What is this?

00:12:41.210 --> 00:12:44.760
I wonder what this is.
Everything here is so mysterious.

00:12:45.010 --> 00:12:46.260
Totally interesting.

00:12:46.430 --> 00:12:47.510
Hey you!

00:13:00.020 --> 00:13:01.280
It's a Red Bug.

00:13:04.740 --> 00:13:07.450
No... Don't touch that...

00:13:09.120 --> 00:13:10.030
Finish him off?

00:13:10.200 --> 00:13:12.580
-It just spoke.
-It did.

00:13:12.750 --> 00:13:16.540
I've never seen this type of bug before.
Let's investigate.

00:13:16.710 --> 00:13:18.460
If you say so, Sis.

00:13:19.250 --> 00:13:22.300
I thought it was just a cry.
Did it really speak?

00:13:22.460 --> 00:13:24.840
Yeah, it said "totally" or something.

00:13:25.430 --> 00:13:27.760
-It's awake!
-It's looking at us!

00:13:31.220 --> 00:13:34.350
Where am I? Who are you?

00:13:34.850 --> 00:13:36.310
-It spoke!
-It did!

00:13:36.480 --> 00:13:39.690
It must be Nushi. I must exterminate it!

00:13:40.310 --> 00:13:44.360
Is it a new type?
I've never seen a bug speak so fluently.

00:13:44.530 --> 00:13:46.110
Where are the leaves?

00:13:46.280 --> 00:13:49.200
-This bug looks soft.
-It's a weird bug.

00:13:49.370 --> 00:13:52.330
I... I'm a human. I'm not a bug.

00:13:53.120 --> 00:13:55.460
Human? We are the humans here.

00:13:55.910 --> 00:13:58.250
Your color. You must be a Red Bug.

00:13:58.420 --> 00:13:59.500
What do you mean?

00:13:59.670 --> 00:14:01.750
Is it a bug pretending to be human?

00:14:01.920 --> 00:14:03.340
That's scary.

00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:07.800
But he does look similar to us.
Is it a new type?

00:14:07.970 --> 00:14:09.760
You can speak?

00:14:10.260 --> 00:14:12.890
Where do you come from? Any other bugs?

00:14:13.430 --> 00:14:15.810
What's a bug?

00:14:16.430 --> 00:14:19.310
Where am I? Who are you?

00:14:19.480 --> 00:14:21.980
-Bugs are bugs.
-They squiggle around.

00:14:22.150 --> 00:14:23.900
The red ones attack us.

00:14:24.070 --> 00:14:28.240
This is Island One.
We're sisters, and we live here.

00:14:28.450 --> 00:14:29.570
-Rinacchi.
-Rinaji.

00:14:29.740 --> 00:14:31.240
-Rinayo.
-Rinamu.

00:14:31.740 --> 00:14:32.830
Where are you from?

00:14:32.990 --> 00:14:35.200
Were you hiding by the water?

00:14:35.370 --> 00:14:36.790
I-I don't know.

00:14:36.950 --> 00:14:37.910
Who are you?

00:14:38.080 --> 00:14:42.130
Me? I... I'm Wakaba.

00:14:42.380 --> 00:14:46.670
And you are Rinacchi, Rinaji-san, and...

00:14:46.840 --> 00:14:49.010
We're Ritsu and Rin.

00:14:49.510 --> 00:14:51.590
-Can I eat him?
-No!

00:14:51.760 --> 00:14:54.010
-Why not?
-What is he?

00:14:54.260 --> 00:14:57.730
He doesn't look like a bug.
But the color of his blood...

00:14:58.770 --> 00:15:00.020
That glowing tree.

00:15:00.190 --> 00:15:01.310
It's Midori-chan.

00:15:01.480 --> 00:15:03.440
I saw a glow like that downstairs.

00:15:03.610 --> 00:15:06.070
Of course. The roots are connected.

00:15:06.230 --> 00:15:09.360
Wow, amazing! It's that long?

00:15:09.530 --> 00:15:11.110
So interesting.

00:15:15.490 --> 00:15:17.040
We'll shoot him and see.

00:15:17.580 --> 00:15:18.910
Are you satisfied, Sis?

00:15:19.870 --> 00:15:22.920
Shoot? You're going to shoot me?

00:15:23.080 --> 00:15:25.590
Yes, with Midori-chan's leaves.

00:15:25.750 --> 00:15:28.710
-Bugs crumble when they're hit.
-Demolished!

00:15:29.130 --> 00:15:31.260
Demolished...?

00:15:42.730 --> 00:15:44.400
I guess it can't be helped.

00:15:44.690 --> 00:15:48.400
It seems like you're all very wary.

00:15:48.650 --> 00:15:51.650
You must've been through
a lot of hardships.

00:15:52.860 --> 00:15:55.240
Sorry for causing this panic.

00:15:55.410 --> 00:15:59.700
And if something that looks like me
has been troubling you, I'm sorry.

00:16:00.120 --> 00:16:02.580
Did I hurt any of you earlier?

00:16:02.920 --> 00:16:07.000
Or maybe I soiled your water.
I hope it's still okay.

00:16:07.960 --> 00:16:09.420
What a strange bug.

00:16:09.590 --> 00:16:14.340
I've never spoken so much
with a bug. It feels weird.

00:16:15.550 --> 00:16:17.220
Enough. I'm exterminating him.

00:16:18.310 --> 00:16:19.890
One last thing.

00:16:20.890 --> 00:16:23.060
What is that thing? I'm so curious.

00:16:23.940 --> 00:16:25.020
It's Kemurikusa.

00:16:25.190 --> 00:16:26.610
What a mysterious glow.

00:16:27.150 --> 00:16:29.530
Is that your special power?

00:16:29.820 --> 00:16:32.530
Wow, that's so interesting.

00:16:34.660 --> 00:16:36.990
Thank you, I feel better knowing now.

00:16:58.680 --> 00:16:59.970
It doesn't work on him?

00:17:00.140 --> 00:17:01.850
A bug that's immune to Midori-chan?

00:17:02.020 --> 00:17:03.270
That's strange.

00:17:03.560 --> 00:17:05.650
Then how do we exterminate it?

00:17:11.780 --> 00:17:13.320
What is it, Rin?

00:17:13.490 --> 00:17:15.240
His red scars... They're gone.

00:17:16.240 --> 00:17:17.370
What is he?

00:17:18.740 --> 00:17:21.120
Is it over yet?

00:17:21.740 --> 00:17:24.660
Please don't make it hurt too much...

00:17:27.420 --> 00:17:28.790
It's another Red Bug.

00:17:28.960 --> 00:17:31.000
-Again?
-Too many!

00:17:31.170 --> 00:17:32.590
Where? A big one?

00:17:32.840 --> 00:17:35.630
It sounds like it. The location is...

00:17:37.430 --> 00:17:38.680
By the Wall square?

00:17:38.840 --> 00:17:40.970
There's so much noise.

00:17:41.180 --> 00:17:43.390
The fog might have come up on land.

00:17:43.720 --> 00:17:45.600
It's close. Just one, right?

00:17:45.770 --> 00:17:47.190
So far up on land.

00:17:48.020 --> 00:17:49.480
It's coming this way.

00:17:49.650 --> 00:17:52.230
-What do we do?
-We can't let it come close.

00:17:52.530 --> 00:17:54.110
I'll slay it at the square.

00:17:54.280 --> 00:17:55.650
Thank you.

00:17:56.030 --> 00:17:57.700
-Be careful.
-But him...

00:17:59.490 --> 00:18:03.290
Is it over yet? I... Um...

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:05.500
Huh? Where did you go?

00:18:08.540 --> 00:18:11.090
Whoa, so high! And so fast!

00:18:14.010 --> 00:18:15.630
-There.
-There you go.

00:18:16.670 --> 00:18:18.260
You're taking him?

00:18:18.430 --> 00:18:22.100
I can't think of a way to exterminate him.
We need to keep watch.

00:18:22.260 --> 00:18:24.020
Why not just cut him up?

00:18:24.180 --> 00:18:25.890
Red Bugs don't die that way.

00:18:26.060 --> 00:18:27.980
Cut me up...?

00:18:29.100 --> 00:18:29.980
There it is.

00:18:37.030 --> 00:18:38.280
Keep an eye on him.

00:18:38.450 --> 00:18:39.530
Gotcha.

00:18:39.700 --> 00:18:41.990
Sis, can you tell where it is?

00:18:42.160 --> 00:18:44.240
If it comes out of the red fog.

00:18:45.200 --> 00:18:48.410
The red fog has never come so far
up on land.

00:18:48.580 --> 00:18:52.170
My throat burns. It must be close.

00:18:54.340 --> 00:18:56.090
Rin, be careful.

00:18:58.170 --> 00:18:59.470
What is this?

00:18:59.630 --> 00:19:00.630
It's the red fog.

00:19:00.800 --> 00:19:02.760
You're a bug but you don't know?

00:19:04.510 --> 00:19:08.020
It sure is red. And a bit warm?

00:19:09.770 --> 00:19:11.020
It's hot!

00:19:11.310 --> 00:19:15.110
You shouldn't touch it.
It's hard enough even for Rin.

00:19:15.270 --> 00:19:17.820
-You'll melt.
-Wakaba is so stupid.

00:19:19.740 --> 00:19:21.860
Does the red fog work on him?

00:19:22.280 --> 00:19:24.200
We could exterminate him in it.

00:19:25.990 --> 00:19:27.910
A bug that can't bear the red fog?

00:19:28.080 --> 00:19:29.660
-Funny.
-A funny bug.

00:19:29.830 --> 00:19:33.170
Does that mean
he really isn't a bug?

00:19:33.710 --> 00:19:34.920
Then what is he?

00:19:35.090 --> 00:19:38.380
But where is the Red Bug?

00:19:38.550 --> 00:19:41.590
I can't hear it in this red fog.

00:19:41.800 --> 00:19:43.220
Maybe in the building?

00:19:43.390 --> 00:19:46.180
This has a strange smell.

00:19:46.890 --> 00:19:49.680
Huh? I feel something hot.

00:19:49.850 --> 00:19:51.100
Over there.

00:20:01.450 --> 00:20:02.610
There it is.

00:20:02.780 --> 00:20:04.870
I'll beat you up and eat you whole!

00:20:20.340 --> 00:20:21.800
Where are you, Rinayo?

00:20:21.970 --> 00:20:23.050
Rinayo-chan!

00:20:29.680 --> 00:20:32.560
Sis, Rina, stay away from the fog.

00:20:36.060 --> 00:20:38.940
Where is it, dang it.

00:20:39.730 --> 00:20:42.530
What now? Not again, no...

00:20:52.790 --> 00:20:55.790
Rin-san, over there. On your left!

00:20:57.210 --> 00:21:01.800
There's a hot spot.
Just like when it first came out.

00:21:01.960 --> 00:21:02.840
Is that...?

00:21:03.010 --> 00:21:05.470
Why would I trust you?

00:21:05.630 --> 00:21:07.220
You're right.

00:21:07.550 --> 00:21:10.140
But the girl that got caught!

00:21:10.310 --> 00:21:13.310
Why is he trying to help us?

00:21:14.440 --> 00:21:15.440
But...

00:21:17.520 --> 00:21:18.730
I know.

00:21:21.360 --> 00:21:24.030
I'll go and get her.
You won't mind, right?

00:21:34.620 --> 00:21:38.040
It's hot... Ouch...

00:21:39.210 --> 00:21:41.960
What do we do, Rin? Do we just let him?

00:22:10.280 --> 00:22:12.030
That was amazing.

00:22:13.540 --> 00:22:14.500
Why?

00:22:14.660 --> 00:22:19.080
That big clump was emitting heat,
so I thought maybe...

00:22:19.250 --> 00:22:23.380
No, why did you do that?
I thought you were scared of it.

00:22:24.760 --> 00:22:26.470
Oh, that's right.

00:22:28.010 --> 00:22:31.930
I forgot when I saw
how worried you looked.

00:22:32.760 --> 00:22:35.470
You must really care for your sister.

00:22:35.980 --> 00:22:38.440
Just what are you?

00:22:40.150 --> 00:22:43.900
I'm so relieved, I'm so happy.

00:22:44.070 --> 00:22:46.190
Sis Ritsu, it's not that big a deal.

00:22:46.610 --> 00:22:48.610
Are all the Red Bugs gone now?

00:22:49.360 --> 00:22:51.820
Yes, the fog has lifted, so we're safe.

00:22:51.990 --> 00:22:53.950
I'm so relieved...

00:22:54.450 --> 00:22:56.620
All thanks to Rin and Wakaba-kun.

00:22:56.790 --> 00:23:00.040
How did you know where the Red Bug was?

00:23:00.210 --> 00:23:03.630
The red fog seemed a little warm.

00:23:03.960 --> 00:23:05.750
I'm not sure, though.

00:23:05.920 --> 00:23:08.170
You were just like Riku-chan.

00:23:08.720 --> 00:23:12.470
Keep an eye on him.
I'll go check the area just in case.

00:23:12.760 --> 00:23:13.720
Stay on guard.

00:23:16.020 --> 00:23:17.060
What...?

00:23:17.520 --> 00:23:19.770
What to do with him.

00:23:20.350 --> 00:23:23.110
First off, let's tie him up again.

00:23:25.020 --> 00:23:25.940
Why...?

00:23:27.610 --> 00:23:30.280
What's happening?
